# Data and parsing

Schema lives in EF Core (`WorkCostsDbContext` + `Data/Migrations`). Swift follows those migrations. Do not fork column names.

Product images and page cache are **files**; SQLite holds paths/metadata (`CachedWebPages`, `CachedWebImages`). Do not put new large blobs in the database.

Parsers: `ProductPageMetadataParser` + HTML fixtures in `WorkCosts.Tests/Fixtures`. New host = detector + parser + snippet tests + `ProductPageClientValues` fields. Source/vendor come from the URL host and page seller.

Live fetch uses a real browser session when HttpClient is blocked (Autodoc). Paste-HTML is a planned product feature (`docs/parsing/paste-html.md`).
